{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S02、S04、S13等段落的感受词仍然偏密，部分意象连续堆叠，容易让观众把注意力从人物心事转移到逐条解读感受上。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用短句分开人物的念头、顾虑和行动，重点词放大后，观众即使边听边扫，也更容易抓住每段发生了什么，以及他为什么这样做。感受与话语交替、部分感受随音乐到时出现，使音乐变化和心理变化更容易对应；从最初不敢表达，到害怕失去，再到接受自己愿意付出，前后形成了清楚的情感轨迹。X的完整句子有较好的叙述连贯性，但左侧文字需要连续阅读，右侧感受有时只是并列的标签，人物心理与音乐细节之间的对应不如Y细腻。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1c98d11a-2e2f-4a6e-9e3b-3b7eb1ca6a3d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210522897917Z", "elapsed_seconds": 61.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:06:24.010691+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7c8a600dab4ecbc52b4ab98cb485edd6cdac19fe5b1021aa47b851ffff1d5856", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "